FGA_CHECK:212-5.1-i	2026-11-18 20:15:43 UTC	GPT-6 Astra, ChatGPT Pro mode, this run	independent re-proof	For b in B, form the characteristic polynomial of multiplication by p2 prime(b) on the finite projective B-algebra C via p1 prime. Its rank may vary: choose a common upper bound N and multiply each locally constant rank-r characteristic polynomial by T^(N-r). An arrow from x to y identifies the outgoing-arrow schemes at y and x by composition, preserving their targets. Hence the two pullbacks of this monic polynomial to the relation agree, coefficient by coefficient, including the rank padding; every coefficient lies in A. Cayley-Hamilton makes p2 prime(b) a root in C. Restricting along the identity section makes b a root in B. Thus every b is integral over A. The finite-projective characteristic polynomial and Cayley-Hamilton are standard algebraic inputs; the invariant-coefficient argument has been checked here using the groupoid composition.	212, p. 110, Theorem 5.1(i)	french_school_pro_checks_20261117_work/returns/FGA_CHECK_checkpoint_12_20261119T0612Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
FGA_CHECK:212-5.1-ii	2026-11-18 20:19:06 UTC	GPT-6 Astra, ChatGPT Pro mode, this run	independent re-proof	Integrality and the inclusion A in B give surjectivity and a closed, hence quotient, map on spectra by lying-over. Every relation orbit lies in a fibre. Conversely let primes p and q lie over the same prime of A, with q outside the finite orbit of p. Incomparability for integral extensions shows q is contained in none of the primes in that orbit; prime avoidance gives b in q outside all those primes. Its invariant norm along p1 of p2 prime(b), constructed as in 5.1(i), vanishes at q because the identity section is a factor, but is nonzero at p because b is a unit at every point of that finite fibre. This contradicts equality of the contractions to A. Thus the fibres are precisely the orbits. Lying-over, incomparability and prime avoidance are the standard algebraic inputs.	212, pp. 110–111, Theorem 5.1(ii)	french_school_pro_checks_20261117_work/returns/FGA_CHECK_checkpoint_12_20261119T0612Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
