fam:src:A.5.2	2026-11-18	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	used and rechecked in this run	Re-read and re-derived the precise original-cusp dependency used by II inv:E2.2/E15. In the complete receiving Koszul/direct-image proof, the kernel of the restricted ambient cotangent map is nu_*O_dP6 times the common conormal dq; its global section space is one-dimensional. Gorenstein Serre duality gives h2(W,T_X|W)=1. Top-degree base change and generic rank1 force the cusp R2T stalk free over C{q}, hence the upper modification with quotient C_p0; the branch-normal quotient is nu_*K_dP6 by the explicit coefficient map and invariant volume form. This is a renewed local application check, not another whole-proof credit.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
