inv:E2.2	2026-11-18T04:50:08.441928+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Full root-bundle, tangent direct-image, cusp modification and middle-Hodge-number calculation on the stated m≥12 comb members. The retained real homology/cohomology classes give nonzero vertical and Hodge-quotient sections on ordinary fibres, finite covers and the explicit cusp graph; source Combs Proposition6.1 pp19–21 supplies the actual logarithmic periods log(q)I/(2πi)+H(q), and Section6.3 p23 supplies the complete Hodge quotient extension. The stabilizer exponents(2,1) and coarse determinant2m−1 give root weight24m−1 for both E and G; detH is trivial by its determinant-one monodromy and trace-zero residue. The log tangent determinant and removal of the actual cusp divisor O(12) give K=O(−24m−6). Weighted monomials show H0O(5)=0, and factoring E→O(5) through its quotient gives the remaining form vanishings. Independently recomputed the invariant multiplication carry s⁴/s=t at the order3 point and no order4 carry, so degρ*(E⊗G)=8m−3, H1=0 and h0=8m+1. The two KS cup maps are injective because the cusp leading matrix is invertible. Their root determinants and exact local character sums give coarse degrees2m−2 and6m−2, hence a length4m cokernel away from the cusp. Read and independently derived fam:src:A.5.2’s branch-normal map, conormal kernel generated by ydx,xdy or yzdx,xzdy,xydz, common dq gluing, Gorenstein Serre duality h²(T|W)=1, and rank-one DVR residue criterion. Thus the free R²T line increases by p0, descending to O(2m), while the separate torsion length4m remains. Leray yields tangent tuple(2m+1,8m+1,6m+1,0). For the cotangent sequence the exact degree difference is4m, its other kernel is a rank3 bundle K_m, and residue dq/q gives O_B(−2). Rational normalization kills higher residue cohomology. Leray and χ(Ω¹)=−1 give h11=4m+1+h0K_m and h12=4m+h0K_m. The source’s actual classifying-family lower bound is8m−8 (Lemma8.2/Proposition8.3 pp27–28 and specializationp30); no claim is made about a smooth family joining the comb to X0. New derivation after reading the supplied proof; not a blind review and not an independent human check.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
