erified in the specified scope""}, {""ledger"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/attached_maps_source_checks.json"", ""key"": ""mapsEngel"", ""opened_locators"": [""Lemma2.1 complete proof, source334–392; original rational elliptic surface setup288–334"", ""Lemma3.8 source842–863 and Remark8.3 source1685–1723, previously opened in the PaperI current-reader credit matrix; Remark8.3 reopened here""], ""scope"": ""The actual narrow section6P has height6, (6P).O=2 and P.(6P)=2, giving the translation line bundle O(1). The regular invariant character and quotient idea are credited to Engel. The literal cusp extension needs the full corrected construction transferred to PaperI; the published remark alone is not treated as a proof of that correction."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}], ""additional_source_ledgers"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/retained_angle_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/push_C_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/root/classical_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/cdp_audit/maps_E/references_verified.json""], ""program_check_records"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_runs/fourfolds_B6_plumbing.run.json""], ""program_ledgers"": [""deliverables/code/maps_audit/selected_reruns.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/final_small_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/kummer_full_checks.json"", ""deliverables/code/root_maps_F/final_execution_reconciliation.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/audit_notes.md"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json""], ""record"": ""work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json""} Recorded outcome: Passed full receiving proof and exact operative-source checks at the stated scope; historical partial checks and repaired gaps are preserved.. This continuat