rogram reviews remain separately itemized rather than inferred from receiving reads."", ""exact_source_check_records"": [{""ledger"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/remaining_primary_source_checks.json"", ""key"": ""mapsCrowleyNordstrom21"", ""opened_locators"": [""Published edition MathAnn381(2021)29–74, online8June2020; §2.1 pp.34–35"", ""Lemma2.1 and §2.2 equation(2.1), published p.35 (PDF7), visually opened; matching authorv4 pp.4–5 separately read""], ""scope"": ""The boundary is a closed spin7-manifold with torsion-free H4, and the actual Spin-c coboundary has a determinant class with a relative lift. With p1(boundary)=0 the source normalization is Z/28. Substituting p-hat=(p1+z^2)/2 and dividing by28 yields (p1^2-4sigma)/896-p1*z^2/192+z^4/384, exactly B6.9. Its relative products and the zero-shear case are verified in the receiving proofs; both spin lifts induce the same boundary Spin-c structure when H2 vanishes."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}], ""additional_source_ledgers"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/retained_angle_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/push_C_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/root/classical_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/cdp_audit/maps_E/references_verified.json""], ""program_check_records"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_runs/maps_free_circle.run.json""], ""program_ledgers"": [""deliverables/code/maps_audit/selected_reruns.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/final_small_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/kummer_full_checks.json"", ""deliverables/code/root_maps_F/final_execution_reconciliation.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/audit_notes.md"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json""], ""record"": ""work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json