maps:src:B.6.18	2026-11-17	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_09_PAPERS	targeted proof check	"Received S6_09 writing record: {""reader"": ""GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI, ChatGPT Pro mode)"", ""effort"": ""Pro"", ""date"": ""2026-11-17"", ""full_receiving_proof_read"": true, ""current_check_event_ids"": [""prior-fable-statements-b6-20261116"", ""new-maps-fixed-conifold-read-20261117"", ""new-maps-primary-scope-20261117:mapsJin26"", ""new-maps-final-small-program-20261117:maps_quotient_classification.py""], ""receiving_read_records"": [{""event_id"": ""new-maps-fixed-conifold-read-20261117"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""Full four proofs read and rederived, including free-circle conifold model, Jin invariant identification, spin trace, and actual cubic collar computation. Associated arithmetic reruns pass.""}, {""event_id"": ""new-maps-primary-scope-20261117:mapsJin26"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""The actual quotient is S2xS3, spin and simply connected with no torsion in homology. Preserving the primitive circle Euler class and orientation makes the return Torelli. The source is an isotopy classification, using Lemma2.1, not merely a rational characteristic detection. Its primitive and doubled-sphere twists have (cube,p1*x)=(1,4),(8,8). Thus their bordism coordinates ((4k-ell)/24,k) are (0,1),(1,8), an integral basis; ell=-4 gives A+2B=-1 and k=-1+6B.""}, {""event_id"": ""new-maps-final-small-program-20261117:maps_quotient_classification.py"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""Exact inverse of the characteristic-number matrix with determinant-24 and the ell=-4 specialization. Does not evaluate the remaining integer B or prove Jin’s classification.""}], ""source_dependency_status"": ""Closed in the exact operative scopes recorded; provider citation/program reviews remain separately itemized rather than inferred from rec