pe"": ""The boundary is a closed spin7-manifold with torsion-free H4, and the actual Spin-c coboundary has a determinant class with a relative lift. With p1(boundary)=0 the source normalization is Z/28. Substituting p-hat=(p1+z^2)/2 and dividing by28 yields (p1^2-4sigma)/896-p1*z^2/192+z^4/384, exactly B6.9. Its relative products and the zero-shear case are verified in the receiving proofs; both spin lifts induce the same boundary Spin-c structure when H2 vanishes."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}], ""additional_source_ledgers"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/retained_angle_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/push_C_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/root/classical_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/cdp_audit/maps_E/references_verified.json""], ""program_check_records"": [], ""program_ledgers"": [""deliverables/code/maps_audit/selected_reruns.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/final_small_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/kummer_full_checks.json"", ""deliverables/code/root_maps_F/final_execution_reconciliation.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/audit_notes.md"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json""], ""record"": ""work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json""} Recorded outcome: Passed full receiving proof and exact operative-source checks at the stated scope; historical partial checks and repaired gaps are preserved.. This continuation preserves the earlier scope; pre-reading derivation order is not inferred."		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:B.6.19	2026-11-18	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	Rederived the actual parametrized spin handle, ordinary Wang groups, Borel lift and fixed-section injection, and relative Thom restriction. The primitive alpha restricts to y, p1 coefficient is ell-2k, and the middle form has absolute determinant|k|. With the independently completed cup value-1, both p1-square and4*signature agree. The receiving historical conditional wording is replaced by the completed forward dependency; B6.20 is restricted to its numerical conclusion to keep the proof dependencies acyclic.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
