maps:src:B.6.24	2026-11-17	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_09_PAPERS	targeted proof check	"Received S6_09 writing record: {""reader"": ""GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI, ChatGPT Pro mode)"", ""effort"": ""Pro"", ""date"": ""2026-11-17"", ""full_receiving_proof_read"": true, ""current_check_event_ids"": [""new-maps-B-remaining-full-20261117:B.6.24"", ""new-maps-B-program-20261117:maps_trace_linking.py"", ""new-maps-primary-scope-20261117:mapsCrowleyNordstrom21""], ""receiving_read_records"": [{""event_id"": ""new-maps-B-remaining-full-20261117:B.6.24"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""Both boundary spin choices; equality of the actual primitive boundary torsion generator; rank-one reciprocal linking forms fix the trace sign for |k|>2; |k|=1 cancellation and |k|=2 Eells–Kuiper denominator exclusion; all positive multiplicities and exact zero class.""}, {""event_id"": ""new-maps-B-program-20261117:maps_trace_linking.py"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""All-positive-d exact rational free/trace cancellation, opposite-sign relation, and d=2 denominator contradiction. Identification of the actual boundary torsion generator and trace is a separate geometric prerequisite.""}, {""event_id"": ""new-maps-primary-scope-20261117:mapsCrowleyNordstrom21"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""The boundary is a closed spin7-manifold with torsion-free H4, and the actual Spin-c coboundary has a determinant class with a relative lift. With p1(boundary)=0 the source normalization is Z/28. Substituting p-hat=(p1+z^2)/2 and dividing by28 yields (p1^2-4sigma)/896-p1*z^2/192+z^4/384, exactly B6.9. Its relative products and the zero-shear case are verified in the receiving proofs; both spin lifts induce the same boundary Spin-c structure when H2 vanishes.""}], ""source_dependency_status"": ""Closed in the exact operative scopes recorded; provider citation/program reviews remain separately itemized rather than inferred from receiving reads."", ""exact_source_check_records"": [{""ledger"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/remaining_primary_source_checks.json"", ""key"": ""mapsCrowleyNordstrom21"", ""opened_locators"": [""Published edition MathAnn381(2021)29–74, online8June2020; §2.1 pp.34–35"", ""Lemma2.1 and §2.2 equation(2.1), published p.35 (PDF7), visually opened; matching authorv4 pp.4–5 separately read""], ""scope"": ""The boundary is a closed spin7-manifold with torsion-free H4, and the actual Spin-c coboundary has a determinant class with a relative lift. With p1(boundary)=0 the source normalization is Z/28. Substituting p-hat=(p1+z^2)/2 and dividing by28 yields (p1^2-4sigma)/896-p1*z^2/192+z^4/384, exactly B6.9. Its relative products and the zero-shear case are verified in the receiving proofs; both spin lifts induce the same boundary Spin-c structure when H2 vanishes."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}], ""additional_source_ledgers"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/retained_angle_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/push_C_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/root/classical_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/cdp_audit/maps_E/references_verified.json""], ""program_check_records"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_runs/maps_trace_linking.run.json""], ""program_ledgers"": [""deliverables/code/maps_audit/selected_reruns.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/final_small_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/kummer_full_checks.json"", ""deliverables/code/root_maps_F/final_execution_reconciliation.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/audit_notes.md"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json""], ""record"": ""work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json""} Recorded outcome: Passed full receiving proof and exact operative-source checks at the stated scope; historical partial checks and repaired gaps are preserved.. This continuation preserves the earlier scope; pre-reading derivation order is not inferred."		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:B.6.24	2026-11-18	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	Checked the actual outgoing torsion generator comparison between disc bundle and spin trace. Equality of its linking value forces the same rank-one sign for|k|>2. At|k|=1 the correction is0 for either sign; at|k|=2 the opposite sign would give±1/112, excluded by the actual sphere invariant subgroup(1/28)Z/Z. The two characteristic expressions then cancel for every coprime reference-fan family.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:B.6.24	2026-11-18T05:22:24.250604+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	used and rechecked in this run	Source mapsCrowleyNordstrom19; opened locus: Author version3,29December2018: opening spin conventions p1; Section1.4 equations(2)–(3), p5; Remark2.36 p24. Read the exact formula and its index/gluing justification: for a closed spin seven-manifold whose spin characteristic class p_M is torsion, (p_W²−sigma(W))/8 is independent of spin coboundary in Q/28Z. The source states no H4 torsion-free hypothesis here. With p_W=p1(W)/2 and division by28 this is (p1²−4sigma)/896 in Q/Z. B6.5 uses its integral-p1-zero trace; B6.15 uses the same formula for torsion p1 on an H4=Z⊕Z/|k| boundary. This matches the received mapsCrowleyNordstrom19 author/title/arXiv/DOI10.1112/plms.12222. CrowleyNordstrom2019 is declared only as an identical-work source-key alias, with the same authors/title/DOI; no separate pre-existing bibliography entry of that name was found and no separate reading is counted. Source-opening record only; no additional whole-proof review is inferred.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
