maps:src:B.6.3	2026-11-18T03:54:20.433015+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Full smoothing monodromy on integral middle cohomology Read and rederived the complete proof. The added logarithm L_s of1-st cancels exactly between beta_c,s and ell_s, retaining b_h and the explicit scalar h_s^12=t^4/((t-1)^3(1-st)). The actual finite/root/cusp maps give A1,A2,Cw,Cd with product one; S=I-2E commutes with all four. Re-derived the local invariant-cycle identifications for every exterior degree using finite free transfer and the actual degree-zero line translations in the nodal product. In exterior degree2 the four image ranks are4,4,2,2; relation and coboundary ranks are5 each, leaving H1 dimension2. Computed the displayed P1–4 representatives and both exact coboundaries for wedge^2(S^-t)-I. The base has cohomological dimension2, so E2^(1,2) survives; b3=2 from the stated earlier integral topology exhausts it. The resulting rational identity on H3, together with its integral torsion freeness, proves the integral identity.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:B.6.3	2026-11-18T03:54:20.433015+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	computation or formal certificate	pass Current exact smoothing and mapping-torus programs Read both received programs and executed unchanged copies at03:46:50–51UTC. Source/copy SHA256 values agree in current_execution.json. The smoothing program reproduces the exterior-square image/relation/coboundary ranks, all displayed cocycles and the exact correction coboundaries. The mapping-torus program reproduces the nilmanifold cohomology and verifies that gamma u and gamma omega vanish in global coinvariants. The generic nil-fibre invariant classes are not asserted to extend globally: the manuscript proof separately uses the actual skyscraper and connecting-map calculation.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
