maps:src:B.6.4	2026-11-18T03:54:20.433015+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Full affine defects, critical-cycle vanishing and central mapping class Read and rederived the full proof, including the local-to-global spectral-sequence step. The two actual affine defects are(0,1,-1,-1) and(0,0,-1,1), and d1+A1d2=0. The nil-fibre differential is dtheta=2kappa gamma. Under the full inverse-transpose actions, (Cw*-I)gamma omega=-gamma u and (A2tilde*-I)gamma u=gamma omega-gamma u-gamma kappa, with gamma kappa exact; thus both candidate Wang classes die in global coinvariants. The local rank-one-zero critical fibres contribute precisely the two skyscraper classes kappa gamma u and kappa gamma omega. Their connecting map has representatives -gamma u/2,-gamma omega/2 and is zero by the just computed coinvariants. There are no higher differentials, and the Wang b3 count exhausts global H3. Restricting to the actual critical traces makes gamma a multiple of kappa, proving their rational homology classes zero. For the complex vertical bundle, the saturated rank-two subbundle has a nowhere-zero abstract section and c2=0; the K-class identity [E]=[V]+[L]-[L|C] and the local Koszul resolution give c2(E)=PD[C], hence p1=-2PD[C]=0 rationally and then integrally by H4=Z^2. Opened Krylov §2.1 pp2–4: the actual normal-clutch map detects the two stable generators by absolute Pontryagin number4, and its zero kernel is the supported-disc Theta7 subgroup because S3 times S3 bounds the framed S3 times D4. The stated conclusion therefore follows for the actual return.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
