maps:src:E.1.3	2026-11-17	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_09_PAPERS	targeted proof check	"Received S6_09 writing record: {""reader"": ""GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI, ChatGPT Pro mode)"", ""effort"": ""Pro"", ""date"": ""2026-11-17"", ""full_receiving_proof_read"": true, ""current_check_event_ids"": [""new-fourfold-read-20261117"", ""new-E13-pure-weight-source-closure-20261117""], ""receiving_read_records"": [{""event_id"": ""new-fourfold-read-20261117"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""Full proofs of listed statements read except the still unresolved geometric d2 identification in F.2.6. Exact matrix, discriminant, period and LSAP-tube programs pass. The actual LSAP bundle-section theorem, Nagy inertia theorem and Jin statements have been opened.""}, {""event_id"": ""new-E13-pure-weight-source-closure-20261117"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json"", ""scope"": ""Closed the exact original mixed-Hodge spectral-sequence source and the projective toric normalization hypotheses.""}], ""source_dependency_status"": ""Closed in the exact operative scopes recorded; provider citation/program reviews remain separately itemized rather than inferred from receiving reads."", ""exact_source_check_records"": [{""ledger"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_and_weight_source_checks.json"", ""key"": ""mapsDeligne1974HodgeIII"", ""opened_locators"": [""Scholie8.1.9, printed p.30; text1164–1217"", ""Theorem8.1.15, printed pp.32–33, complete statement and printed proof8.1.17; text1252–1432, including Lemma8.1.18,8.1.19 and Proposition8.1.20"", ""Proposition8.3.5 and its complete printed proof, pp.42–43; text1685–1749; p.42 (PDF p.39) visually opened""], ""scope"": ""Proposition8.3.5 makes E1^(p,q)=H^q(X_p,Z)⇒H^(p+q)(X_bullet,Z) a spectral sequence of mixed Hodge structures for a separated simplicial scheme. At C3=0 the finite 2Z3 toroidal cover has smooth projective toric strata and algebraic face maps. Add the degenerate simplices to the finite normalization semisimplicial scheme; its normalized alternating complex is unchanged. Each H^q(stratum,Q) is pure of weightq, so E2^(p,q) is pure of weightq. For r>=2 the differential changes q to q-r+1 and is therefore zero. Finite deck invariants are exact overQ. The explicitly computed integral E2 groups are free, so rational vanishing implies integral vanishing inductively, and extensions of free abelian groups remain free."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}, {""ledger"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/fourfold_priority_source_checks.json"", ""key"": ""ffChen"", ""opened_locators"": [""Author manuscript dated September1,2021, title page"", ""TheoremA and surrounding hypotheses pp.2–3; TheoremB p.4, exact sequence visually verified""], ""scope"": ""E1.3 uses the C3=0 family after the finite deck-lattice cover 2Z^3. The already printed properness proof and unimodular toric charts give a proper holomorphic map, smooth away from0, with smooth total space and SNC central fibre. The strictly coherent positive quadratic function Q=4 sum n_i^2-(sum n_i)^2 supplies a relative projective polarization, hence a Kähler total space over the disc. These are Chen’s exact hypotheses. Complex surjectivity onto monodromy invariants implies rational surjectivity by scalar extension; finite deck invariants are exact over Q."", ""status"": ""verified in the specified scope""}], ""additional_source_ledgers"": [""deliverables/work/maps_audit/references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/retained_angle_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/invariants_arithmetic/push_C_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/root/classical_references_verified.json"", ""deliverables/work/cdp_audit/maps_E/references_verified.json""], ""program_check_records"": [], ""program_ledgers"": [""deliverables/code/maps_audit/selected_reruns.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_remaining_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/final_small_program_manifest.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/kummer_full_checks.json"", ""deliverables/code/root_maps_F/final_execution_reconciliation.json"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/audit_notes.md"", ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/check_events.json""], ""record"": ""work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json""} Recorded outcome: Passed full receiving proof and exact operative-source checks at the stated scope; historical partial checks and repaired gaps are preserved.. This continuation preserves the earlier scope; pre-reading derivation order is not inferred."		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
