grams and the independent E1.4 exterior page."", ""references"": [], ""shared_dependency_records"": [{""source_id"": ""MAPS E1.3"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/fourfold_priority_source_checks.json"", ""scope"": ""Chen Theorem B, plus projective finite cover and rational invariant cycles; integral specialization remains its separate full geometric proof.""}, {""source_id"": ""MAPS E1.3"", ""record"": ""deliverables/work/maps_audit/maps_B_and_weight_source_checks.json"", ""scope"": ""Deligne Hodge III Proposition8.3.5 pp42–43, complete printed proof; projective toric pure-weight application separately matched in maps_B_and_weight_application_checks.json.""}], ""outcome"": ""No unaddressed mathematical objection remains in this assigned receiving proof; all E-specific source and program checks are completed."", ""scope_limit"": ""This does not certify unrelated portions of the external literature or replace separately owned B/D full-program records.""}] Recorded outcome: complete receiving proof independently checked; operative source matches and E-specific exact programs completed. This continuation preserves the earlier scope; pre-reading derivation order is not inferred."		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
