maps:src:F.2.16	2026-11-17	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_09_PAPERS	targeted proof check	Received S6_09 writing record: Complete independent receiving-proof reading and derivation, all operative source-hypothesis matches, and actual finite program reruns completed. Detailed proof-by-proof reasoning and exact limits are retained in the linked records. Recorded outcome: Passed in precisely the printed scope. Per-input termination is not a finite global enumeration; punctured-base periods with one bounded cusp correction do not imply simultaneous finite good reduction.. This continuation preserves the earlier scope; pre-reading derivation order is not inferred.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:F.2.16	2026-11-18T02:27:56.235122+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Complete unbounded-family, all-lattice obstruction and rational (5,4) normal form Read all six full proofs. Re-derived the individual finite-action complex structures from even real eigenspaces; XY nilpotence and Y(A+I)^(-1)X=I; symbolic integral overlattice and primitive cusp image; the nonselfdual pencil determinant obstruction; the q=v^2-v+1 torsion in the specified lattice; and the residual subobject/quotient dichotomy for every invariant lattice at primes outside 2,5. The four-dimensional residual pair is absolutely irreducible: one-dimensional factors force simultaneous orders 5 and 4 to be 1, and a 2+2 split forces a -I block incompatible with its unipotent quotient. For v=1 the explicit order-four monomial conjugacy and theta=a+4k marking give torsion d2 residue 1 in the retained degrees. For the rational normal form, the exact centralizer action gives the projective beta parameter, the ten linear constraints have the displayed cubic determinant, positive Q1 and the two adjugate rows isolate both exceptional projective points; one is inconsistent and the other is the complete affine solution line. The three current unchanged programs supplement, rather than replace, these geometric and universal arguments.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:F.2.16	2026-11-18T02:27:56.235122+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	computation or formal certificate	pass Three unchanged exact rational/integral family replays Reran unchanged fourfolds_unbounded_family.py, fourfolds_v1_homology.py and fourfolds_relative_normalform.py; all exited zero. The first proves polynomial identities over Q[v] and retains its bounded -6..10 diagnostics separately. The second checks all exterior/Smith and monomial/torsion transgression matrices in the specified finite dimensions. The third checks the rational generic normal form and both exceptional strata exactly, including rank 8 versus augmented rank 9 at [3:2:1], rank 9 affine line at [4:1:3], and C^4=I on that line. Original code hashes and separate current outputs are retained.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
