maps:src:F.2.20	2026-11-18T02:27:56.235122+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Complete unbounded-family, all-lattice obstruction and rational (5,4) normal form Read all six full proofs. Re-derived the individual finite-action complex structures from even real eigenspaces; XY nilpotence and Y(A+I)^(-1)X=I; symbolic integral overlattice and primitive cusp image; the nonselfdual pencil determinant obstruction; the q=v^2-v+1 torsion in the specified lattice; and the residual subobject/quotient dichotomy for every invariant lattice at primes outside 2,5. The four-dimensional residual pair is absolutely irreducible: one-dimensional factors force simultaneous orders 5 and 4 to be 1, and a 2+2 split forces a -I block incompatible with its unipotent quotient. For v=1 the explicit order-four monomial conjugacy and theta=a+4k marking give torsion d2 residue 1 in the retained degrees. For the rational normal form, the exact centralizer action gives the projective beta parameter, the ten linear constraints have the displayed cubic determinant, positive Q1 and the two adjugate rows isolate both exceptional projective points; one is inconsistent and the other is the complete affine solution line. The three current unchanged programs supplement, rather than replace, these geometric and universal arguments.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
