maps:src:F.2.26	2026-11-18T02:43:58.020152+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	computation or formal certificate	pass Five unchanged universal survivor replays All five final runs exited zero: relative order-six normal form, universal (5,6) obstruction, local finite caps, primitive cusp boundary, and survivor tests v=0,1,2. The cusp and universal-obstruction first attempts completed their algebra then failed only because the expected records output directory was absent; those failed stdout files are preserved. Creating that directory and rerunning the unchanged sources gave exit zero. The complete normal form and exceptional line were checked symbolically; no finite parameter sample is asserted to classify the rational locus.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
maps:src:F.2.26	2026-11-18T02:43:58.020152+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Remaining rational locus, universal order-six exclusion and exact survivor criterion Read all five full proofs. Re-derived the modified normal-form traces, conic/cubic incompatibility and full exceptional line. At three the primitive norm forces the permutation-three plus two negative lines; its middle skew Smith form is (1,1,3,3), so the sixfold cap contributes nonzero 3-primary torsion, which cannot disappear through the finite Leray filtration kernel. Re-derived the full abelian twist presentation, the prime-to-p cap isogenies, the actual order-four torsion boundary coefficient one and the primitive cusp degree-four contribution. The six Smith/parabolic tests are exactly the complete H3 and H5 filtrations. The complete survivor classification then follows by exhaustive rational enumeration, finite input-dependent lattice enumeration, these tests and the current explicit Wall-form/Kramer–Stolz proof. All five associated source replays passed, with two output-directory failures preserved and repaired without source modification.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
