maps:src:F.2.31	2026-11-18T02:43:58.020152+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	computation or formal certificate	pass Eight unchanged group and chain replays All eight programs exited zero: full van Kampen, thirty logarithmic-family cases, complete involution classes, bar/Koszul and cyclic comparisons, affine caps, complete Kuhn cap/boundary/collapse, noncommuting global complement, and peripheral signs. The Kuhn computation rebuilds every object, incidence, flag, differential and collapse map, then checks the full integral cap, boundary and relative homology. The global-complement script runs the stated156 Fox and156 noncommuting simplices, and peripheral_signs checks its seven cases. This event does not claim a current rerun of the three full closed eight-dimensional integration drivers.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
