night:P3F.10	2026-11-18T04:20:43.877643+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Original regular page, integral torsor section, line cap and stable-frame number Read the complete proof. The three actual Seifert relations give the determinant-one (3,4) weighted-sphere map. The quotient map has the positive Lefschetz local chart (x,y,gamma)->(xy,gamma). The radial equation identifies the regular page with b^3-a^4=1; the exact degree12 Mobius cover gives genus3, one boundary and twelve positive critical points. The chosen phase avoids the short fixed-sphere arc. The integral j_*Lambda obstruction vanishes by the independent nodal meridian restrictions on the free punctured fundamental group, and the fine Lie sequence constructs an actual smooth torsor section. The normalized see-saw quotient is pulled back from the base, so the line becomes M+nF. On the boundary the relative gauge-square terms vanish by the actual cup products, making the square independent of the extension; the sectioned compact page has M^2=-2. The full affine derivative and diagonal U1 factors have zero Cartan cubic transgression, hence relative p1=-24. Corrected the damaged j_*Lambda typography. The normal-frame input uses the explicitly typed K9 line comparison.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
