push:src:E.5.3	2026-11-18T04:50:08.441928+00:00	GPT-6 Astra (OpenAI), ChatGPT Pro mode, effort Pro, S6_10_PAPERS	targeted proof check	proved Full parameter-domain, intrinsic-base, period comparison, finite norm and all-collar gluing classification. Read the adjacent exact parameter setup, including the inverse contracting generator and Π_mu,c=[[2z,tau,1,0],[beta+c,z,0,1]], lambda=exp(−2πic), and checked all four covariance identities in the source replay. Opened ViaTwo Proposition6.1pp17–18 and Proposition6.4pp19–20 in full. Uniform unit/contraction bounds on a smaller closed mu-disc give the actual half-plane family; all markings and ℓ/4 extend on its simply connected parameter domain. The canonical form extends through uv=q, xyz=q and s=r⁴ with the actual r³ line-frame correction, giving the intrinsic anticanonical pencil. Differentiating the discriminant roots yields p_i′=−9/(2p_i); an affine velocity relation would give a quadratic with three roots and nonzero constant. The resulting cross-ratio is locally injective and disjoint from its inverse, fixing mu and the base map. The exact common centralizer and constant last two period columns force A=alpha I and lattice map alpha(I−hE41). Summing the actual root-generator defects and using N4Λ=4Zℓ+2Zδ forces alpha=1 and h even. For h=2n the explicit b*=−h(u+w)/4 and L*=−hu/2 satisfy the root conjugacy; the integral defects0,hu/2,−hw/2 lie in the actual three vanishing lattices and satisfy the full sphere cocycle identity. Rank-one node translations and the rank-two fan shifts extend with holomorphic unit remainders and have extending inverses. The remaining difference sheaf is the actual invariant pushforward of E=O⊕O(−1) on P(1,4), as established from its nonzero line field and the verified canonical determinant; its H1 vanishes. Correcting the resulting Cech cocycle therefore glues the four exact local maps and their inverses. A width<2 logarithm strip gives the original small-bidisc injectivity. No extension to arbitrary mu or arbitrary prescribed punctured translations is inferred. New derivation after reading the supplied proof; not a blind review and not an independent human check.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
