ari:C.4.4	2026-11-18	Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic) at effort max, S6_10 intake	computation or formal certificate	Agrees. Own sympy script (S6_10_INTAKE_code/torsion_exact.py) on the model of Paper I line 2085 (A=-(3/4)t^3(t-1), B=(1/4)t^4(t-1)^2, P=(0,t^2(t-1)/2)): Delta=27t^8(t-1)^3, j=1728t; division polynomials psi_2..psi_8 at P give exactly the printed squarefree factors F_4=5t-32, F_5, F_6, F_7, F_8 (Paper I lines 391-397; P never 2- or 3-torsion on smooth fibres); with m=n-1 in the division identity the norm values on the order-4 and order-6 loci are exactly 10, 17+10sqrt3, 10sqrt3-17, as tabulated.		s6_pro_prompts_20261112_work/returns/S6_SERIES_GRIND_checkpoint_10_20261120T0211Z_unzipped/CHECK_EVENTS.tsv	
